# pylock.ios.toml is intentionally TRACKED here — this is an on-device gate
# example, and its lock records the exact wheel hashes that build, launch and
# render on the iOS simulator. Regenerating it would detach that result from
# the binaries it was obtained from.
#
# (It was previously kept as "the canonical path-wheel reference"; Phase 6
# repointed this example at the wheels index, so it now records url + sha256
# and no example demonstrates the path shape.) See "Example-repo lock policy"
# in docs/design/common/03-lockfile-concept.md.
